      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t think the sdus_mask can be meaningless. A value of 9 will mean that the device supports data units of size 4096 bytes and 512 bytes.",
      "revId": "77ae4e2b579dff29039c9277e28b892d76fc014a",
