        "id": 1368904
      },
      "writtenOn": "2020-04-14T17:27:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So the crypto_cap_array.algorithm_id expects to have enums like MMC_CRYPTO_ALG_AES_XTS, not \nMSDC_CRYPTO_ALG_AES_XTS. MMC_CRYPTO_ALG_AES_XTS is 0, and is different from MSDC_CRYPTO_ALG_AES_XTS, which is 4.\nSimilarly for crypto_cap_array.key_size.\n\nAlso, is the crypto_cap_array.reserved actually used at all? If not, why not just keep it set to 0?",
      "revId": "77ae4e2b579dff29039c9277e28b892d76fc014a",
